// Ledgerline service contracts.
//
// Flow: a client calls Orders.CreateOrder. Orders writes the order and an OrderCreated event
// in one transaction (the outbox); the outbox worker delivers it to Payments.HandleOrderCreated.
// Payments charges once and writes the payment and a PaymentCaptured event in one transaction;
// a worker delivers that to Ledger.ApplyPaymentCaptured, which writes two balanced entries.
// Delivery is at-least-once; every handler is idempotent on event_id, so each event takes
// effect exactly once.
